  "itemUsage": {
    "en": "A tuner never without her tuning fork. Just give her an out-of-tune instrument or any wonky-sounding device... and your worries will be gone.",
    "zh": "音叉不离手的调谐师，只需要给她一件音准有问题的乐器，或者任何听起来不妙的装置……非常令人省心。",
    "source": "official",
    "isMachineTranslation": false
  },
  "itemDesc": {
    "en": "Her perfect pitch makes it a bit hard for her to fit in, but she's trying her hardest to improve her communication skills... right?",
    "zh": "绝对音感让她有些许游离在外，不过，她自己也在很努力地提高沟通能力……吧？",
    "source": "official",
    "isMachineTranslation": false
  },
